The contents of this directory — the machine-readable results in
seed_confound_demo_jericho-*.json, seed_path_demo_jericho-*.json and
audit_frotzenv_seeding_*.json — are released under the Creative Commons
Attribution 4.0 International licence
(CC BY 4.0): https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

The audit artifact quotes single lines of third-party source code as evidence for
each verdict, with a commit-pinned permalink to the original. Those excerpts
remain under their own projects' licences; the CC BY 4.0 grant above covers the
classification and the compilation, not the quoted lines.

The code that generates and validates them is MIT licensed; see ../LICENSE.

